This is my suitcase.
I open my suitcase.
My clothes are in it.
I take the clothes out.
There is one more thing in the suitcase.
It is a photo frame.
This is a photo of my family.
My parents are in the photo.
This is my younger sister Sofia.
And this is my elder brother Diego.
Our dog Lola is also in the photo.
My family is in Mexico.
I put this photo frame on the table.
Now this room is not empty.
Now this is my room.
I smile.
